message: "If you use this tool in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Project Scheduling & Control"
abstract: "A bilingual (English/Arabic) interactive web tool for teaching the Critical Path Method (CPM): automatic forward and backward passes, total and free float, detection of all critical paths, an animated Gantt chart, an activity-on-node network diagram and a generated schedule analysis."
type: software
authors:
